\n    <p class=\"indent\">In recent days, we have to face 1 problem----A, which is becoming more and more</p>\n    <p class=\"indent-small\">serious. First, -------------(说明A的现状).　Second, -------------(举例进一步说明现状)</p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">Confronted with A, we should take a series of effective measures to cope with the</p>\n    <p><em>situation.</em> For one thing, --------------(解决方法一). For another --------------(解决方法二).</p>\n    <p>Finally, --------------(解决方法三).</p>\n    <p class=\"personal\">Personally, I believe that --------------(我的解决方法). Consequently, I’m confident</p>\n    <p class=\"future\">that a bright future is awaiting us because --------------(带来的好处).</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder logo\" aria-label=\"Logo at lower-right\">\n    <span class=\"sprout\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"logo-caption\">[Logo: lower-right]<br>[illegible]</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"lower-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"star\">※</span>中考英语作文万能模板： 说明利弊题型</h2>\n    <div class=\"lower-copy\">\n      <p class=\"line-one\">这种题型往往要求先说明一下现状，再对比事物本身的利弊，有时也会单从一</p>\n      <p class=\"line-two\">[?]角度（利或弊）出发，最后往往要求考生表明自己的态度（或对事物前景提出预</p>\n      <p class=\"line-three\">）</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"lower-item\">1、 说明事物现状</div>\n  <div class=\"handwriting bottom-note\">你可以拒绝学习[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"purple-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-note-two\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">18</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
